 verify eligibility. Any mistake returns you to Level 1.</string><string name="puzzle_level_indicator">Level %1$d of 5</string><string name="puzzle_btn_submit">Submit Answer</string><string name="puzzle_error_failed">Incorrect answer. Discipline requires patience. Returning to Level 1.</string><string name="puzzle_success_level">Correct! Proceeding to next level.</string><string name="puzzle_all_completed_title">Puzzles Solved!</string><string name="puzzle_all_completed_desc">You have successfully solved all 5 consecutive challenges. You are now eligible to submit an extra time request to your Administrator.</string><string name="puzzle_btn_proceed_request">Submit Extension Request</string><string name="puzzle_accessibility_toggle">Accessibility Text Mode</string><string name="puzzle_accessibility_hint">Accessibility Mode: Simplified high-contrast textual reasoning prompt enabled.</string><string name="ext_title">Request Extra Allowance</string><string name="ext_subtitle">Submit a request for temporary additional minutes. Your Administrator reviews and determines approvals.</string><string name="ext_minutes_label">Additional Minutes Requested</string><string name="ext_minutes_hint">e.g. 10 (Max 30)</string><string name="ext_reason_label">Constructive Reason</string><string name="ext_reason_hint">Explain why additional time is necessary…</string><string name="ext_btn_submit">Submit to Administrator</string><string name="ext_history_title">Your Requests</string><string name="ext_status_pending">Pending Review</string><string name="ext_status_approved">Approved (+%1$d min)</string><string name="ext_status_denied">Denied</string><string name="ext_status_modified">Modified (+%1$d min)</string><string name="ext_admin_notes">Admin Note: %1$s</string><string name="admin_title">Administrator Console</string><string name="admin_tab_invites">Invites</string><string name="admin_tab_users">Users &amp; Limits</string><string name="admin_tab_extensions">Requests</string><string na